    "text": "A capillary tube $(\\mathrm{A})$ is dropped in water. Another identical tube $(\\mathrm{B})$ is dipped in a soap water solution. Which of the following shows the relative nature of the liquid columns in the two tubes?\n<img src=\"assets\\qt0174_d206772b5ca5.png\"><br>"
