  "solution": {
    "text": "Capillary rise $\\mathrm{h}=\\frac{2 \\mathrm{~T} \\cos \\theta}{\\rho \\mathrm{gr}}$. As soap solution has lower $\\mathrm{T}, \\mathrm{h}$ will be low."
